  "text": "PDF\nF5 TMSH Reference - 17.x\nTMOS Shell (tmsh) references are collections of the available* BIG-IP\ntmsh man pages\n. To get started, review the\ntmsh man page\n.\nYou can find\ntmsh\nhelp for these topics:\nGeneral\nCommands\nModules\nDownload the full TMSH reference\nPDF\n.\n* The available tmsh man pages will depend upon the BIG-IP system’s provisioned modules.",
